{
  "name": "Moedin.IA - WhatsApp LITE (texto -> banco)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": { "httpMethod": "POST", "path": "moedin-whatsapp", "responseMode": "responseNode", "options": {} },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [-960, 300],
      "id": "wh-lite",
      "name": "Webhook WhatsApp",
      "webhookId": "moedin-whatsapp"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": { "assignments": [
          { "id": "g1", "name": "telefone", "value": "={{ (($json.body && $json.body.telefone) || ($json.body && $json.body.data && $json.body.data.key && $json.body.data.key.remoteJid) || '').toString().split('@')[0] }}", "type": "string" },
          { "id": "g2", "name": "text", "value": "={{ ($json.body && $json.body.text) || ($json.body && $json.body.data && $json.body.data.message && $json.body.data.message.conversation) || '' }}", "type": "string" }
        ] },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [-740, 300],
      "id": "global-lite",
      "name": "global"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.SUPABASE_URL }}/rest/v1/rpc/resolve_user_by_phone",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": { "parameters": [
          { "name": "apikey", "value": "={{ $env.SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY }}" },
          { "name": "Authorization", "value": "=Bearer {{ $env.SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY }}" },
          { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
        ] },
        "sendBody": true, "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={ \"p_phone\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.telefone) }} }",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [-520, 300],
      "id": "http-user-lite",
      "name": "Resolver usuario"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": { "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "strict", "version": 2 }, "conditions": [
          { "id": "c-found", "leftValue": "={{ $json.found }}", "rightValue": "", "operator": { "type": "boolean", "operation": "true", "singleValue": true } }
        ], "combinator": "and" },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [-300, 300],
      "id": "if-user-lite",
      "name": "Usuario cadastrado?"
    },
    {
      "parameters": { "respondWith": "json", "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ ok: false, mensagem: 'Numero nao cadastrado. Cadastre-se no app e salve este telefone no perfil.' }) }}", "options": {} },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [-80, 140],
      "id": "resp-naocad-lite",
      "name": "Responder nao cadastrado"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.AI_SERVICE_URL }}/parse-text",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": { "parameters": [ { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" } ] },
        "sendBody": true, "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={ \"text\": {{ JSON.stringify($('global').item.json.text) }} }",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [-80, 380],
      "id": "http-ia-lite",
      "name": "Interpretar (ai-service)"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": { "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "strict", "version": 2 }, "conditions": [
          { "id": "c-ok", "leftValue": "={{ $json.ok }}", "rightValue": "", "operator": { "type": "boolean", "operation": "true", "singleValue": true } }
        ], "combinator": "and" },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [140, 380],
      "id": "if-ok-lite",
      "name": "Interpretou?"
    },
    {
      "parameters": { "respondWith": "json", "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ ok: false, mensagem: $json.erro || 'Nao entendi. Ex: gastei 50 no mercado.' }) }}", "options": {} },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [360, 540],
      "id": "resp-erro-lite",
      "name": "Responder erro"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.SUPABASE_URL }}/rest/v1/rpc/resolve_category",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": { "parameters": [
          { "name": "apikey", "value": "={{ $env.SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY }}" },
          { "name": "Authorization", "value": "=Bearer {{ $env.SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY }}" },
          { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
        ] },
        "sendBody": true, "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={ \"p_user_id\": {{ JSON.stringify($('Resolver usuario').item.json.user_id) }}, \"p_name\": {{ JSON.stringify($('Interpretar (ai-service)').item.json.categoria) }} }",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [360, 360],
      "id": "http-cat-lite",
      "name": "Resolver categoria"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.SUPABASE_URL }}/rest/v1/transactions",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": { "parameters": [
          { "name": "apikey", "value": "={{ $env.SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY }}" },
          { "name": "Authorization", "value": "=Bearer {{ $env.SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY }}" },
          { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "name": "Prefer", "value": "return=representation" }
        ] },
        "sendBody": true, "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"user_id\": {{ JSON.stringify($('Resolver usuario').item.json.user_id) }},\n  \"type\": {{ JSON.stringify($('Interpretar (ai-service)').item.json.tipo) }},\n  \"amount\": {{ $('Interpretar (ai-service)').item.json.valor }},\n  \"description\": {{ JSON.stringify($('Interpretar (ai-service)').item.json.descricao) }},\n  \"notes\": {{ JSON.stringify($('Interpretar (ai-service)').item.json.texto_original) }},\n  \"transaction_date\": {{ JSON.stringify($('Interpretar (ai-service)').item.json.data) }},\n  \"competence_month\": {{ JSON.stringify($('Interpretar (ai-service)').item.json.competence_month) }},\n  \"category_id\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.category_id) }},\n  \"source\": \"whatsapp\",\n  \"status\": \"active\",\n  \"origin_type\": \"manual\"\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [580, 360],
      "id": "http-tx-lite",
      "name": "Criar transacao"
    },
    {
      "parameters": { "respondWith": "json", "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ ok: true, mensagem: '✅ ' + ($('Interpretar (ai-service)').item.json.tipo === 'income' ? 'Receita' : 'Gasto') + ' de R$ ' + Number($('Interpretar (ai-service)').item.json.valor).toFixed(2) + ' em ' + ($('Interpretar (ai-service)').item.json.categoria || 'sem categoria') + ' registrado.' }) }}", "options": {} },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [800, 360],
      "id": "resp-ok-lite",
      "name": "Responder sucesso"
    },
    {
      "parameters": { "content": "## Moedin.IA - WhatsApp LITE\n\nVersao simples e facil de rodar: so usa **variaveis de ambiente** (sem credenciais no n8n, sem Redis).\n\nFluxo: Webhook -> identifica usuario pelo telefone -> ai-service interpreta o texto -> grava em transactions -> aparece no site.\n\n**Env necessarias (ja no docker-compose):** SUPABASE_URL, SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY, AI_SERVICE_URL\n\n**Testar:**\nPOST {webhook}/webhook/moedin-whatsapp\n```\n{ \"telefone\": \"5511999999999\", \"text\": \"gastei 50 no mercado\" }\n```\nObs: funciona sem OpenAI (parser por regra). Com OPENAI_API_KEY no ai-service, fica mais esperto.", "height": 360, "width": 520, "color": 4 },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [-960, -120],
      "id": "note-lite",
      "name": "Doc"
    }
  ],
  "pinData": {},
  "connections": {
    "Webhook WhatsApp": { "main": [[{ "node": "global", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "global": { "main": [[{ "node": "Resolver usuario", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Resolver usuario": { "main": [[{ "node": "Usuario cadastrado?", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Usuario cadastrado?": { "main": [
      [{ "node": "Interpretar (ai-service)", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
      [{ "node": "Responder nao cadastrado", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
    ] },
    "Interpretar (ai-service)": { "main": [[{ "node": "Interpretou?", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Interpretou?": { "main": [
      [{ "node": "Resolver categoria", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
      [{ "node": "Responder erro", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
    ] },
    "Resolver categoria": { "main": [[{ "node": "Criar transacao", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Criar transacao": { "main": [[{ "node": "Responder sucesso", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": { "executionOrder": "v1" },
  "meta": {}
}
